<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dossier refuse - AgriFund</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f3f5f4;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .wrap {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 24px 12px;
        }
        .card {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .head {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7f1d1d 0%, #b91c1c 60%, #ef4444 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 28px 24px;
        }
        .head h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1.3;
        }
        .head p {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }
        .body {
            padding: 24px;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: #fef2f2;
            color: #991b1b;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
        }
        .intro {
            margin: 16px 0 18px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .info {
            background: #f9fafb;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 14px;
            margin: 14px 0;
        }
        .row {
            display: block;
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .label {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .value {
            color: #111827;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .note {
            margin-top: 14px;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #fff7ed;
            border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
            color: #9a3412;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .foot {
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6b7280;
            background: #fafafa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="head">
                <h1>Dossier refuse</h1>
                <p>La verification admin n'a pas pu valider votre justificatif.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="body">
                <span class="badge">Refuse</span>

                <p class="intro">
                    Bonjour {{ utilisateur.prenom }},<br>
                    Votre justificatif pour <strong>{{ achat.offre ? achat.offre.nomOffre : (achat.produit ? achat.produit.nomProduit : achat.reference) }}</strong> a ete refuse apres verification.
                </p>

                <div class="info">
                    <div class="row"><span class="label">Reference dossier: </span><span class="value">{{ achat.reference }}</span></div>
                    <div class="row"><span class="label">Montant: </span><span class="value">{{ achat.montant|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} {{ achat.devise }}</span></div>
                    {% if transaction.gatewayPayload is not empty and transaction.gatewayPayload.rejection_reason is defined %}
                        <div class="row"><span class="label">Motif: </span><span class="value">{{ transaction.gatewayPayload.rejection_reason }}</span></div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>

                <div class="note">
                    Vous pouvez soumettre un nouveau justificatif depuis votre espace agriculteur pour relancer la verification.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="foot">
                AgriFund - Notification automatique. Merci de ne pas repondre a cet email.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
